### Configuração
# @name config
# Rodando local (npm run dev, usa backend/.env -> PORT=3002).
# Se estiver testando contra o docker-compose, troque para http://localhost:3000
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
            
### Registro
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuario Teste",
  "email": "teste@estudyia.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "teste@estudyia.com",
    "password": "senha123"
}

### Login com credenciais inválidas (deve retornar 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@estudyia.com",
  "password": "senhaerrada"
}

### Usuário autenticado (usa o cookie accesToken devolvido pelo login acima)
# @name me
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Cookie: accesToken={{login.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}
